  m_text: '<b>Cooperative Hall of Fame</b>


    Linda Leaks Archiving Project


    <i>Film
    Installation</i>


    A short film honoring the organizers, tenants, and neighbors
    who built Black-led cooperative housing.


    <i>Select the vintage camera to
    play the film.</i>'
